ere, mischievous and a little cynical. \nYou may arrange the clothes and accessories as you like! \nThe plushie is optional. There are extra details in the reference link that are optional to read.\nReference link https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aw9dO75a4vUAtHIQyxAmA-iIy7ScVczA?usp=sharing\n\nComposition\nI really love the pixel art style you drew here https://twitter.com/yum23930955/status/1651490309820522496?s=20 and was wondering if I could have something similar! \nYou may choose the pose and expression freely. I like dark, cute, and 地雷系 atmosphere and elements. However, please draw anything you'd like. \n\nUsage\nSNS purposes and vtuber activities.\n\nI apologize if there is any rudeness or mistakes with the translation of the request.\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yum23930955/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1799230, "client_id": 878279, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/adadc15a/uploads/origins/7e3ef0d4-8d3e-408d-98f8-23b1150518af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84cbe5d2d36f054b672c1404fb2a1634", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/adadc15a/uploads/origins/7e3ef0d4-8d3e-408d-98f8-23b1150518af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84cbe5d2d36f054b672c1404fb2a1634, https://si.imgix.net/adadc15a/uploads/origins/7e3ef0d4-8d3e-408d-98f8-23b1150518af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b9aec5857bf5b34637b85c09b450df6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/adadc15a/uploads/origins/7e3ef0d4-8d3e-408d-98f8-23b1150518af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc7e613018b99e7a7a0303777117fb87 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si